## Clean scoreboard

<!--SCOREBOARD-->

The reduced rows remain pinned to the published V7.5.17 CPU campaign. Both
full-terminal rows come from the combined V7.6.6 clean pass. Recipe columns
are historical and are not direct deltas against the current clean contracts.

TSMC6 remains in the denominator as a controlled repeat of TSMC7. Their
LEVEL=72 data are identical, so disagreement measures training and Newton-basin
variability rather than an independent technology result.

## Evidence and reproduction

Each family report is published only from one complete campaign. The V7.6.6
full-terminal evidence requires 480 jobs and 280 checkpoint artifacts; partial
passes are never backfilled from older evidence. Raw evidence is local and
gitignored under `results/v766_full_clean/`, with datasets, checkpoints, and
training logs in the sibling `results/v766_full_*` roots. Reproduction commands
are owned by the repository [README](../../README.md).
